<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll" itunes:timing="Line" xml:lang="ja"><head><metadata><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1"/><amll:meta key="ncmMusicId" value="2067699871"/><amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1796128316"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="Here, the world!"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="sumimi"/><amll:meta key="album" value="Here, the world!"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithub" value="149807805"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithubLogin" value="Ma-hiru"/></metadata></head><body dur="04:23.240"><div begin="00:02.072" end="04:19.949"><p begin="00:02.072" end="00:05.534" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L1">"Here, the world!" 繫ごう<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">“Here, the world！” 连接起来吧</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">“ Here the world”</span></p><p begin="00:05.883" end="00:09.471" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L2">鼓動 リズム 生まれるニューソング<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">自心跳与律动中诞生的崭新曲目</span></p><p begin="00:09.857" end="00:16.218" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L3">"Here, the world!" 未来は 明るいよ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">“Here, the world！”未来可是一片光明</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">“ Here the world”</span></p><p begin="00:16.614" end="00:20.289" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L4">足早な いつものアベニュー<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">脚步轻快地走在街头</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a shi ba ya na i tsu mo no a be nyu u</span></p><p begin="00:20.299" end="00:25.226" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L5">どこ行くの？ (Oh, gosh) I wonder... (Woo)<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">打算去哪里？</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">do ko i ku no ？</span></p><p begin="00:24.463" end="00:28.816" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L6">忙しさを 言い訳にするクセ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">习惯拿忙碌当借口</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">i so ga shi sa wo i i wa ke ni su ru ku se</span></p><p begin="00:28.826" end="00:32.922" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L7">Ah Repeating...それじゃダメだよね<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">翻来覆去的... 这样子可不行呢</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">Ah repeating</span></p><p begin="00:32.932" end="00:36.870" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L8">誰だって Night and day すこし悩んで<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">每个人都日日夜夜</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">da re da 't te night and day</span></p><p begin="00:36.880" end="00:40.799" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L9">光と影 行ったり来たりで<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">在光影之间徘徊</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">hi ka ri to ka ge i 't ta ri ki ta ri de</span></p><p begin="00:40.809" end="00:45.025" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L10">だけどそこで ドラマ始まって<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">然而就在此刻才会产生戏剧性的一幕</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">da ke do so ko de do ra ma ha ji ma 't te</span></p><p begin="00:44.474" end="00:48.598" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L11">未来連鎖ハジけてゆく<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">引起未来一连串的连锁反应</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">mi ra i re n sa ha ji ke te yu ku</span></p><p begin="00:49.090" end="00:52.235" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L12">ねぇ？ I, My, Meは シークレット シルエット<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">对吧？ 我的每一面</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ne ？ I my me ha</span></p><p begin="00:52.245" end="00:57.128" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L13">未知数でしょ 手のひら 舞うDreams<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">充满未知数</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">mi chi su u de sho</span></p><p begin="00:57.138" end="01:00.017" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L14">曖昧だった 夜を 何度<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">跨越无数朦胧的夜晚</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a i ma i da 't ta yo ru wo na n do ko e ta sa ki ga</span></p><p begin="01:00.033" end="01:05.905" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L15">越えた先が 最高の幕開けだよ OK!?<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">在那前方 正是最棒的开幕吧 OK！？</span></p><p begin="01:05.905" end="01:09.350" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L16">Juicy, Juicy moment! 段々Juicy, Juicy oh yeah!<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">Juicy, Juicy moment！ 逐渐 Juicy, Juicy oh yeah！</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">Juicy juicy moment</span></p><p begin="01:09.350" end="01:13.303" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L17">ほら 果汁みたいに Let's bloom together!<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你看 就像果汁一般</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ho ra ka ju u mi ta i ni</span></p><p begin="01:13.727" end="01:17.175" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L18">Juicy, Juicy moment! 益々Juicy, Juicy oh yeah!<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">Juicy, Juicy moment！ 更加 Juicy, Juicy oh yeah！</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">Juicy juicy moment</span></p><p begin="01:17.175" end="01:25.943" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L19">ほら 世界には ヒトリじゃ描けない 夢ばかりだよ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">这个世界满是仅凭一人</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ho ra se ka i ni ha hi to ri ja e ga ke na i</span></p><p begin="01:25.953" end="01:31.684" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L20">"Here, the world!" 繫ごう このメロディー<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">“Here, the world！” 将这旋律连接起来吧</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">“ Here the world”</span></p><p begin="01:33.243" end="01:36.401" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L21">斜に構えてばかりじゃ (Oh, gosh)<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">如果总是不愿端正态度</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">sha ni ka ma e te ba ka ri ja ( oh gosh)</span></p><p begin="01:36.411" end="01:40.344" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L22">世界も 知らんぷりさ ほらNo good (Let it go)<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">整个世界都会对你视若无睹</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">se ka i mo shi ra n pu ri sa</span></p><p begin="01:40.354" end="01:44.407" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L23">オードリーだって ビギナーだったって<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">就连搞笑艺人组合</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">o o do ri i da 't te</span></p><p begin="01:44.459" end="01:48.734" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L24">夢の純度 濁らせずに<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">也不曾让梦想浑浊</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">yu me no ju n do ni go ra se zu ni</span></p><p begin="01:49.103" end="01:52.772" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L25">似てるメランコリー 隠した君と<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">将似曾相识的忧郁</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ni te ru me ra n ko ri i</span></p><p begin="01:52.966" end="01:56.905" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L26">性格違うのに 惹き合う引力<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">明明个性迥异</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">se i ka ku chi ga u no ni</span></p><p begin="01:56.925" end="02:01.081" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L27">些細なセリフ 伏線みたいって<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">微不足道的台词 似乎都埋下伏笔</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">sa sa i na se ri fu fu ku se n mi ta i 't te</span></p><p begin="02:00.529" end="02:04.952" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L28">シアターモードで 気付いてゆく<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">只有在全神贯注投入时才能注意到</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">shi a ta a mo o do de ki du i te yu ku</span></p><p begin="02:05.246" end="02:08.343" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L29">ねぇ？ I, My, Meは シークレット シルエット<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">对吧？ 我的每一面</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ne ？ I my me ha</span></p><p begin="02:08.353" end="02:13.121" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L30">それが良いよ 君と笑うたび<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">这样就好 每当与你开怀欢笑</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">so re ga i i yo ki mi to wa ra u ta bi</span></p><p begin="02:13.206" end="02:16.141" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L31">変わっていく 今日が 明日が<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">每一天都变幻无穷</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ka wa 't te i ku kyo u ga a su ga</span></p><p begin="02:16.151" end="02:21.955" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L32">見違えちゃう 出逢いの魔法かもね OK!?<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">让人耳目一新</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">mi chi ga e cha u</span></p><p begin="02:21.955" end="02:25.410" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L33">Juicy, Juicy moment! 段々Juicy, Juicy oh yeah!<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">Juicy, Juicy moment！ 逐渐 Juicy, Juicy oh yeah！</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">Juicy juicy moment</span></p><p begin="02:25.430" end="02:29.457" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L34">また 宇宙みたいに Let's spread it out!<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">像我的小宇宙一般</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ma ta u chu u mi ta i ni</span></p><p begin="02:29.829" end="02:33.207" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L35">Juicy, Juicy moment! 益々Juicy, Juicy oh yeah!<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">Juicy, Juicy moment！ 更加 Juicy, Juicy oh yeah！</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">Juicy juicy moment</span></p><p begin="02:33.207" end="02:42.384" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L36">このワードローブの 世界の隅から 彩らせていく<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">这个世界就像橱柜一般</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ko no wa a do ro o bu no se ka i no su mi ka ra</span></p><p begin="02:41.592" end="02:43.538" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L37">She, Her, Herって 吸って吐いて<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">无论是她还是他 每个人</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">She her he 't te su 't te</span></p><p begin="02:43.548" end="02:45.275" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L38">生きてるって感じて<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">都在一呼一吸间感受生命的活力</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ha i te i ki te ru 't te ka n ji te</span></p><p begin="02:45.455" end="02:48.943" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L39">踊りだす鼓動 そのすべて ミュージック<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">跃动不止的心跳</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">o do ri da su ko do u</span></p><p begin="02:49.400" end="02:53.203" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L40">地球儀 回せば まだ見ぬ 場所にも<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">转动地球仪</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">chi kyu u gi ma wa se ba</span></p><p begin="02:53.203" end="02:58.544" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L41">ハッピーで飛べそうさ "We're the world!"<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">开心地展翅高飞</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ha 'p pi i de to be so u sa</span></p><p begin="03:14.157" end="03:22.485" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L42">(Woo...) Let's bloom together! (Do!)<span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">Woo</span></p><p begin="03:22.495" end="03:28.420" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L43">Let's spread it out! (Yeah!) 互い願ったまま<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">一起飞翔吧！</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">Let's spread it out ( yeah)</span></p><p begin="03:28.430" end="03:30.272" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L44">パーフェクト シルエット<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">描绘完美无缺的轮廓</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">pa a fe ku to shi ru e 't to</span></p><p begin="03:30.282" end="03:35.125" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L45">未知数でしょ 手のひら 舞うDreams<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">充满未知数</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">mi chi su u de sho</span></p><p begin="03:35.135" end="03:38.056" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L46">曖昧だった 夜を 何度<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">跨越无数朦胧的夜晚</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a i ma i da 't ta yo ru wo na n do ko e ta sa ki ga</span></p><p begin="03:38.066" end="03:43.929" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L47">越えた先が 最高の幕開けだよ OK!?<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">在那前方 正是最棒的开幕吧 OK！？</span></p><p begin="03:43.929" end="03:47.383" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L48">Juicy, Juicy moment! 段々 Juicy, Juicy oh yeah!<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">Juicy, Juicy moment！ 逐渐 Juicy, Juicy oh yeah！</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">Juicy juicy moment</span></p><p begin="03:47.383" end="03:51.426" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L49">ほら 果汁みたいに Let's bloom together!<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你看 就像果汁一般</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ho ra ka ju u mi ta i ni</span></p><p begin="03:51.761" end="03:55.208" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L50">Juicy, Juicy moment! 益々Juicy, Juicy oh yeah!<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">Juicy, Juicy moment！ 更加 Juicy, Juicy oh yeah！</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">Juicy juicy moment</span></p><p begin="03:55.218" end="04:03.969" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L51">ほら 世界には ヒトリじゃ描けない 夢ばかりだよ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">这个世界满是仅凭一人</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ho ra se ka i ni ha hi to ri ja e ga ke na i</span></p><p begin="04:03.969" end="04:07.491" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L52">"Here, the world!" 繫ごう<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">“Here, the world！” 连接起来吧</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">“ Here the world”</span></p><p begin="04:07.850" end="04:12.276" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L53">鼓動 リズム 生まれるニューソング<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">自心跳与律动中诞生的崭新曲目</span></p><p begin="04:11.771" end="04:17.555" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L54">"Here, the world!"(Never end!) 未来を疑わない<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">“Here, the world！”</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">“ Here the world” never end</span></p><p begin="04:17.114" end="04:19.949" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L55">君とね Bless the world!<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">与你一起为世界献上祝福</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ki mi to ne bless the world</span></p></div></body></tt>